{"provider":"github","id":"7307","externalId":"5836250611","revision":"2026-10-13T19:55:17Z","type":"issue","title":"mergeresolve: ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts truncates and stages files in place, under-reporting conflicts","body":"## Problem\nFiles are opened with `os.O_WRONLY|os.O_TRUNC` and staged one at a time. A failure at file k leaves files 1..k-1 staged, so the caller's `git diff --diff-filter=U` under-reports `ConflictingFiles`; a failed Write leaves file k truncated.\n\nLocation: internal/mergeresolve/conflicts.go:ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts (~line 200); caller internal/worktree/worktree.go:resolveBaseSyncConflict\n\n## Scope\nWrite resolved content atomically (temp file + rename), and stage only after all files resolve (or roll back on failure) so the conflict list stays complete.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Injected write/stage failure at file k leaves all files unmodified and unstaged.\n- ConflictingFiles lists every conflicted file.\n- Test covers the failure path.\n\nConfidence: high\nSource: quality-sprint collated findings (lens: latent-bugs, reliability)\n\nNomination key: qs/latent-bugs/internal/mergeresolve/conflicts.go#ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts\n","labels":["area:runner","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7307"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7307","createdAt":"2026-10-13T19:15:25Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T19:55:17Z","readyAt":"2026-10-13T19:40:58Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-13T19:15:25Z","id":5836250611,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7307,"state":"open","title":"mergeresolve: ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts truncates and stages files in place, under-reporting conflicts","updated_at":"2026-10-13T19:55:17Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5836250611,"number":7307,"title":"mergeresolve: ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts truncates and stages files in place, under-reporting conflicts","body":"## Problem\nFiles are opened with `os.O_WRONLY|os.O_TRUNC` and staged one at a time. A failure at file k leaves files 1..k-1 staged, so the caller's `git diff --diff-filter=U` under-reports `ConflictingFiles`; a failed Write leaves file k truncated.\n\nLocation: internal/mergeresolve/conflicts.go:ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts (~line 200); caller internal/worktree/worktree.go:resolveBaseSyncConflict\n\n## Scope\nWrite resolved content atomically (temp file + rename), and stage only after all files resolve (or roll back on failure) so the conflict list stays complete.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Injected write/stage failure at file k leaves all files unmodified and unstaged.\n- ConflictingFiles lists every conflicted file.\n- Test covers the failure path.\n\nConfidence: high\nSource: quality-sprint collated findings (lens: latent-bugs, reliability)\n\nNomination key: qs/latent-bugs/internal/mergeresolve/conflicts.go#ResolveAdjacentLineConflicts\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7307","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:runner","color":"1d76db","description":"Local runner: lifecycle, scheduler, stages, CLI"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instanc